---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of Service for findlocal.community: acceptable use, content and accuracy, affiliate disclosure, and limitation of liability." canonicalPath="/terms">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="faint"><em>Last updated: September 4, 2026</em></p>
    <p>
      Welcome to Find Local. These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the findlocal.community
      website and related services (the "Service"), operated by EH Solutions LLC ("Find Local," "we," "us").
    </p>

    <h2>1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
    <p>By accessing or using the Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.</p>

    <h2>2. Eligibility</h2>
    <p>
      The Service has no user accounts; anyone may browse it. You must meet the legal age required in your jurisdiction to
      attend events involving alcohol or other age-restricted activities. Event organizers and venues, not Find Local, set
      and enforce admission requirements.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Use automated means (bots, scrapers, crawlers) to collect data from the Service beyond what our <code>robots.txt</code> permits, without our written permission. Structured access is available through the <a href="/platform">Find Local platform</a>.</li>
      <li>Interfere with or disrupt the Service, its infrastructure, or other users' access to it.</li>
      <li>Misrepresent Find Local, or present our data as your own or as an official venue listing.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We may restrict or block access that violates this policy at our sole discretion.</p>

    <h2>4. Content, accuracy and intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      Event and venue information is collected from public venue calendars, ticketing pages and other public sources and
      may be incomplete, out of date or wrong. Dates, times, prices and availability can change without notice; always
      confirm with the venue or ticket seller before making plans or purchases. Event names, images and descriptions
      belong to their respective owners and are shown for the purpose of identifying and linking to the event.
      The Service's design, code and compiled dataset are owned by Find Local. Venues and organizers may request
      correction or removal of a listing at any time by emailing us.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Third-party sites and tickets</h2>
    <p>
      Ticket purchases and event registrations happen on third-party sites under their own terms. Find Local is not a party
      to those transactions and is not responsible for their content, pricing, refunds or fulfilment.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Affiliate links and commission disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      Some links on the Service may be affiliate links, and Find Local may receive a commission if you make a purchase
      through them, regardless of whether the purchase is made immediately after clicking or later. Affiliate links do not
      affect the price you pay or which events we show.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Third-party analytics and tracking</h2>
    <p>
      Find Local does not use third-party analytics or session-recording tools and does not set advertising or cross-site
      tracking cookies. Our hosting provider may record aggregate, cookie-free traffic metrics for security and reliability.
      See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Disclaimer of warranties and limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      The Service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent
      permitted by law, EH Solutions LLC is not liable for any loss or damage resulting from your use of the Service or from
      inaccurate, incomplete or outdated event information, including travel costs or missed events.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      These Terms are governed by the laws of the Commonwealth of Massachusetts and the United States, without regard to
      conflict-of-law provisions. Different consumer and data-protection laws may apply depending on your location.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>We may modify these Terms at any time by posting the revised Terms on this page and updating the "Last updated" date. Continued use of the Service after a change constitutes acceptance.</p>

    <h2>11. Contact us</h2>
    <p>Questions about these Terms: <a href="mailto:findlocalinternal@gmail.com">findlocalinternal@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
